CUDA compatibility for eddoursul/Strata@3a19944130d93d204a845234bbb61c1f1fb3b57d.
The existing CUDA 13 batch API stays unchanged. Earlier CUDA uses ordered asynchronous
copies on the same stream, retaining correctness but losing the batch/overlap hint.
The CUDA 12.5 grouped GEMM API is guarded; older cuBLAS uses the fork's existing
per-expert GEMM/side-stream fallback without changing its precision.
